WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,880
No personal electronic devices are allowed on base

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:04,800
Why should all mobile phones and other items with signals be handed over?

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,480
Prevent electronic signals from interfering with internal devices

4
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:07,920
You can apply for return when you leave

5
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:10,440
Father and daughter, father, come with me on the ninth floor.

6
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:16,980
The ninth floor will arrange inspections and accommodations. Don’t worry, we are safe. There will be water here.

7
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:18,020
There will be food too

8
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:25,430
Dad, can we sleep in the bed tonight? Can we wait until the checkup is done?

9
00:00:25,430 --> 00:00:31,960
Dad, let you have a good sleep first

10
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:33,760
Why is there no accommodation here?

11
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:34,920
Do a unified inspection first
